            "**You can work ANY job** \u2014 Unlike some visas that tie you to a specific employer or field, the Opportunity Card allows you to work any job to support yourself. Want to work as a caf\xE9 barista while searching for engineering roles? Allowed. Tutor English while networking? Allowed. This flexibility is huge.",
            "**You can work part-time or full-time** \u2014 No restrictions on hours. Work 20 hours/week or 40+ hours/week. However, most graduates work full-time or close to it to save money and network.",
